## Environment Variables

### Required
```bash
# Supabase
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=  # Server-side only

# Application
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
```

### Optional
```bash
# Stripe
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# Email (if custom SMTP)
SMTP_HOST=
SMTP_PORT=
SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASSWORD=

# Other integrations
MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
MICROSOFT_CLIENT_ID=
```

